        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-ink leading-tight mb-5">Online Therapy in North Cyprus: How It Works and Who It's For</h1>
        <p class="text-ink-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">Online therapy has moved from a pandemic-era compromise to a preferred option for many people. For residents of North Cyprus — whether you are a student, an expat, or someone living outside Famagusta — it removes the most common barriers to getting support.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-12 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <div class="prose-custom space-y-8">

          <div>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">The evidence on online therapy is now substantial. Multiple large-scale studies and meta-analyses have confirmed that video-based therapy produces outcomes equivalent to face-to-face sessions for anxiety, depression, PTSD and most common psychological difficulties. It is not a lesser option — it is a different format with its own genuine advantages.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mb-4">How does online therapy work in practice?</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">A typical online therapy session at Mağusa Psikoloji Centre works like this:</p>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-bold shrink-0">1</div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-1">You book via WhatsApp</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">You message us to arrange a time. We confirm the appointment and send a secure video link — no app download required, just a browser.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-bold shrink-0">2</div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-1">You connect from a private space</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">At the session time, you join from wherever you are — your room, your car, a quiet café corner. The key is privacy and a stable connection. Headphones help significantly.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-bold shrink-0">3</div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-1">The session runs exactly like in-person therapy</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">50–60 minutes. The psychologist listens, reflects, challenges and guides — the same process as a physical session. Many clients forget they are not in the same room within a few minutes.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-bold shrink-0">4</div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-1">Follow-up between sessions</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Any exercises, reflections or resources from the session can be shared via a secure message. The continuity between sessions is the same as with in-person work.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-primary/5 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/15">
            <p class="text-sm text-ink font-medium mb-2">Online therapy is not second-best — for many people it works better</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Some clients find it easier to open up on video than in a clinical room. The home environment feels safer; there is no travel anxiety before a session; and clients in rural parts of North Cyprus can access the same quality of support as those in Famagusta city centre. The research consistently supports these observations.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mb-4">Who is online therapy best suited for in North Cyprus?</h2>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-5 border border-warm-tertiary">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-1.5">International students and university residents</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Living on or near campus, with unpredictable schedules and no private transport, online sessions eliminate the commute and fit around lectures, exams and part-time work.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-5 border border-warm-tertiary">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-1.5">Expats and long-term residents</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Accessing English-language therapy in a small territory is already difficult. Online sessions open up the option of working with a qualified English-speaking psychologist in Famagusta regardless of where in TRNC you live.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-5 border border-warm-tertiary">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-1.5">People with busy or shift-based schedules</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Without the 20–30 minutes of travel time each way, online therapy is easier to fit into demanding working weeks. Early morning, lunchtime and evening slots become practical in a way they are not with in-person sessions.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-5 border border-warm-tertiary">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-1.5">Those with social anxiety or health concerns</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">For people whose anxiety makes public spaces difficult, or who have physical health conditions affecting travel, online therapy removes a significant practical barrier to starting.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mb-4">Privacy and confidentiality in online sessions</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">We use end-to-end encrypted video platforms for all online sessions. Sessions are never recorded. No information about your attendance or content is shared with any third party, including your university, employer or family, except in the narrow legal circumstances that apply to all therapy.</p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">If you are concerned about privacy at your end — for instance, a shared student flat — using headphones and taking the session from a private space (car, library study room, outdoor setting) is usually sufficient.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mb-4">Getting started: booking your first online session</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Step 1: Message us on WhatsApp</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Send us a brief message introducing yourself and what you are looking for. No referral needed, no waiting list.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Step 2: Book your first session</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">We schedule your first full session, confirm your preferred video platform, and send the secure link in advance.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Step 3: Join from anywhere in TRNC</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Your room, your office, your car — wherever gives you 50 minutes of privacy. Stable internet and headphones are all you need.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-accent/5 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-accent/15">
            <p class="text-sm text-ink font-medium mb-2">When is in-person therapy recommended instead?</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">For most concerns, online therapy is equally effective. In-person sessions may be preferable for certain trauma-processing techniques (like EMDR), for clients who find technology frustrating, or for those who value the ritual of leaving home for a session. We offer both formats — and in some cases, a mix of the two.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
